     falling back on bad query values, and escaping.
  2. [1mRoute and nav.[0m Adds the [38;5;153m/deploys[39m route, puts "Deploys" in the nav after "Services", adds server tests for the route
     and its 503, adds two e2e fixture files, and makes a one-line README update.

  [1mThings to look at when you read it:[0m

